                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} x_n \in i_{\alpha_{n+1}}(X_{\alpha_{n+1}})
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi β
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \beta
              be the limit of the
              = succeed "," do
